WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
OD Hazanshu launches Ryu.

2
00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:02.100
Chun-Li jumps forward after the launch.

3
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:02.400
The first downward medium kick hits Ryu in the air.

4
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.200
A second air stomp continues the juggle.

5
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.000
Medium air Hundred Lightning Kicks finishes the airborne sequence.

6
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Both characters recover after the air-Legs finish.
